<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK TO RELEASE NEW MARKKA &amp; TALOUS SEP 18.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK TO RELEASE NEW MARKKA &amp; TALOUS SEP 18.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland will release a new issue of its Markka &amp; Talous publication on Wednesday, the central bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Central bank director and board of management member Matti Vanhala will hold a news conference about the economic outlook decribed in Markka &amp; Talous on Wednesday at 1300 (1000 GMT), the Bank said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
